title: AffinityTest
---
<<declare $selectedPath = "">>

Narrator: The stars burn cold above the temple. The gods watch. The city sleeps.

<<showportrait Left Thoth>>
Thoth: Mortal. You stand at a crossroads. Choose carefully when dawn comes.
<<hideallportraits>>

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

<<showportrait Left Nitiqret>>
<<setpuzzle 𓀀𓁐𓃀:Path_A|𓁷𓎟𓅓:Path_B|𓌱𓈖𓅓:Path_C|𓎟𓀀𓈖:Path_D>>
Nitiqret: Four symbols are carved above the gate. Which do you trace?
Nitiqret: Find 𓀀𓁐𓃀 the mark of Thoth.<br> Find 𓁷𓎟𓅓 the mark of Bast.<br>Find 𓌱𓈖𓅓 the mark of the scholars. <br>Find 𓎟𓀀𓈖 the mark of the merchants. #wordsearch

<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    Nitiqret: You trace the mark of Thoth. The air grows warm. #expression:surprised
    <<addgodaffinity Thoth 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    Nitiqret: You trace the mark of Bast. Shadows gather at your feet. #expression:neutral
    <<addgodaffinity Bast 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_C">>
    Nitiqret: You trace the mark of the scholars. The crowd murmurs approval. #expression:happy
    <<addhumanaffinity Nitiqret 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_D">>
    Nitiqret: You trace the mark of the merchants. A trader nods from across the square. #expression:happy
    <<addhumanaffinity Harwa 2>>
<<endif>>

<<hideallportraits>>
<<fadetonight BackgroundManager>>
Narrator: Night returns. The choice settles into your bones.

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

<<showportrait Left Harwa>>
<<setpuzzle 𓀀𓃀𓁐:Path_A|𓅓𓎟𓁷:Path_B|𓈖𓌱𓅓:Path_C|𓀀𓎟𓈖:Path_D>>
Harwa: A second gate. A second choice. The symbols shift.
Harwa: Find 𓀀𓃀𓁐 the sun god calls again.<br>Find 𓅓𓎟𓁷 the river god beckons.<br>Find 𓈖𓌱𓅓 the scholars have a task for you.<br>Find 𓀀𓎟𓈖 the merchants need a decision. #wordsearch

<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    Harwa: Thoth's influence grows stronger around you. #expression:neutral
    <<addgodaffinity Thoth 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    Harwa: Bast's current pulls at your steps. #expression:surprised
    <<addgodaffinity Bast 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_C">>
    Harwa: The scholars will remember your name. #expression:happy
    <<addhumanaffinity Nitiqret 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_D">>
    Harwa: The merchant quarter opens its doors to you. #expression:happy
    <<addhumanaffinity Harwa 2>>
<<endif>>

<<hideallportraits>>
<<fadetonight BackgroundManager>>
Narrator: The final night descends. All choices are made. The stars align.
<<checkending>>

===

